# Ba Sing Se: "This land enters tapped unless you control a basic land." A replacement effect judged as the land would enter
# (CR 614.12), against the battlefield as it is, so a basic land entering with it is not counted (ruling 2025-10-02). Bot1,
# with no land at all, puts Ba Sing Se and a Forest onto the battlefield together with Redshift's exhaust: Ba Sing Se enters
# tapped, the Forest untapped.

